WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.025
The solution is the x where the two lines meet.

2
00:00:04.026 --> 00:00:08.826
To solve two x plus three equals eleven, draw both sides as lines.

3
00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:13.555
They meet where x is four, so the solution is x equals four.

4
00:00:14.334 --> 00:00:18.509
Change the right side to seven, and the lines meet where x is two.

5
00:00:22.473 --> 00:00:27.198
For two x plus three equals one, they meet at x equals negative one.
